# PLAYTHORN PREMIUM GAME DISCOVERY — ROUND 1 (Part 1)

> Research Date: August 13, 2026
> Status: Evidence-based discovery from live web research

---

## QUALITY SCORING MODEL (Game Quality Score /100)

| Component | Weight | Description |
|---|---|---|
| Gameplay | 25% | Core loop, controls, depth, challenge curve |
| Retention / Replayability | 20% | Session depth, "one more round", progression |
| Visual Quality | 15% | Graphics, animation, art direction, effects |
| Polish / UX | 10% | UI, menus, loading, responsiveness |
| Performance | 10% | Load time, frame rate, stability, mobile |
| Originality | 10% | Unique mechanics, differentiation |
| Audio / Presentation | 5% | Sound, music, overall feel |
| Multiplayer / Social | 5% | Online modes, community, social hooks |

