### Demand Signal → Alternative Mapping

| Famous Demand | Search Volume | Best Legitimate Browser Alternative |
|---|---|---|
| Subway Surfers-type Endless Runner | EXTREME | Stickman Hook, Temple Run clones (if authorized), Level Devil |
| Minecraft-type Voxel Sandbox | EXTREME | **Bloxd.io** (multiple modes, active multiplayer) |
| Fortnite-type Build & Shoot | EXTREME | **BuildNow GG** (dedicated Fortnite-style browser game) |
| Call of Duty-type FPS | EXTREME | **Krunker.io**, **Venge.io**, **Shell Shockers** |
| FIFA-type Football | HIGH | **Penalty Shooters 2**, **Football Legends**, **A Small World Cup** |
| Need for Speed-type Racing | HIGH | **Drift Hunters**, **Madalin Stunt Cars 2**, **PolyTrack** |
| Tetris-type Puzzle | HIGH | **Tetr.io** (competitive, modern, polished) |
| Clash-type Strategy | HIGH | **Kingdom Rush**, **Bloons TD 5**, **CreepTD** |
